    "kind": "prose",
    "apparition_year": 1222,
    "date": "September 3, 1222",
    "text": "A comet appeared in the Samtae constellation. Its tail was directed to the west and 3 Cheok long (GS, GJ, BG).",
    "sources": [
      "Goryeosa",
      "Goryeosa Jeoryo",
      "Jeungbomunheonbigo"
    ],
    "paper": "Lee et al. 2014, Korean Historical Records on Halley's Comet"
  },
  {
